			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741210101,
					"content": "谢谢！谢谢！太感谢了，你们真是我的大救星。我恩里永远不会忘记这份恩情！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210102,
					"content": "这个不提，我更好奇你是怎么落到这种处境的呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210103,
					"content": "唉，那些螃蟹肯定是被烤鸡的香味吸引过来的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210104,
					"content": "我也是被烤鸡的香味吸引过来的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210105,
					"content": "螃蟹和你可不一样！我看它们，大概在考虑是先吃我还是先吃烤鸡，生怕它们最后还是决定新鲜的更好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210106,
						741210109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210106,
					"content": "有道理，还是新鲜的好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210107,
					"content": "欸，我问的是恩里的事情啦！正常人不会被埋在土里吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210108,
					"content": "所以，你需要帮忙吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210111,
					"content": "当然…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210112,
					"content": "呃…二位，当然不用！！不用帮忙把我挖出来！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210113,
					"content": "#呜哇，知道了知道了我们听得到，不用这么大声！那我们走吧，{NICKNAME}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210114,
					"content": "等等，拜托你们等一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210115,
					"content": "嗯？怎么啦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210116,
					"content": "我…呃，咳咳！是这样的！！二位请听好！！这是一种刚发明的美容方法！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210117,
					"content": "都说了不用喊啦！好吵哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210118,
					"content": "二位千万不要怀疑！！我是神智健全的人，选择了这种科学又健康的美容方法！！以自己的力量，将自己埋在了潮湿的砂土中！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210119,
					"content": "请快点离开吧！！不要挡住我的阳光！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210120,
					"content": "呃，那我们走吧…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210121,
					"content": "既然你们好奇！那就没办法了！！那就请听我解释这种美容方法的妙趣吧！！呃，砂土中的沙蚕等动物能够清除…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210122,
					"content": "#（呜哇，好吵。{NICKNAME}，这个人到底怎么回事呀？前言不搭后语的…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210123,
					"content": "（感觉有些蹊跷…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210124,
					"content": "（是喔？你有什么想法吗？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210125,
					"content": "（先看看周围情况吧。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210126,
					"content": "哎，你们要走了吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210127,
					"content": "我们先看看周围的情况，再回来找你喔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210128,
					"content": "好的！！你们赶紧走吧！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210109,
					"content": "比较好奇你为什么埋在土里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210110,
					"content": "对呀！你需要帮忙吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
