				},
				{
					"id": 741210303,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210304,
					"content": "喂！不要不理我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210305,
					"content": "…你好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210306,
					"content": "天气真好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210307,
					"content": "关于那边那个人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210308,
					"content": "什么人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210309,
					"content": "我不知道什么人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210310,
					"content": "我们只是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210311,
					"content": "在这里散步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210312,
					"content": "没错。我们只是在这里散步。两个正在散步的普通人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210313,
					"content": "天气真好。散步真美妙。您不这么认为吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210314,
					"content": "散步是完全正常的事情。您一定可以理解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210315,
					"content": "呃，你们在说什么呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210316,
					"content": "刚刚你们听到呼救的声音了吗？在那边，有个人埋在土里，差点被螃蟹吃掉了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210317,
					"content": "居然会有这种事，发生在我们散步的地方？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210318,
					"content": "发生在这么好的天气里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210319,
					"content": "他要是被螃蟹吃掉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210320,
					"content": "那就太好笑了。我是说，可怜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210321,
					"content": "可惜，我们不会让这种事情发生。我是说，不能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210322,
					"content": "如果我们在散步时遇到了，一定会制止。我是说，如果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210323,
					"content": "你们在这里干什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210324
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210324,
					"content": "散步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210325,
					"content": "都说了，是散步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210326,
					"content": "真的什么都没注意到吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210327,
					"content": "什么也没有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210328,
					"content": "没错，什么也没有。除了，有两个人正在打扰我们的散步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210329,
					"content": "散步是很…个人的事情。我们不喜欢被人打扰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210330,
					"content": "推荐您也找个好地方，去散步。露景泉就很适合。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210331,
					"content": "但这里是我们散步的地方。我是说，感受大自然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210332,
					"content": "所以不希望被人打扰。再见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				}
			]
		},
