					"nextDialogs": [
						741210602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210602,
					"content": "哎吔…我什么都…我这是最新的美容…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210603,
					"content": "呜哇，你们什么时候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210604,
					"content": "我们在散步。散步…是一种运动。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210605,
					"content": "运动会带来移动。移动将我们带到了这里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210606,
					"content": "是你们干的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210607,
					"content": "是的话又…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210608,
					"content": "#亨特，我想起来了。你仔细看看{M#他}{F#她}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210609,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210610,
					"content": "是他提到过的那位，千万不能招惹的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210611,
					"content": "没错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210612,
					"content": "你们在说什么呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210613,
					"content": "没什么，我们只是在散步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210614,
					"content": "没错。我们只是在散步。如果没什么别的事，我们就…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210615,
					"content": "我们就继续散步到别的地方去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210616,
					"content": "欸？你们不用对我干什么可怕的事情吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210617,
					"content": "教训应该已经够了，如果你明白我的意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210618,
					"content": "什么教训？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210619,
					"content": "没什么。我是说，烤鸡很危险，会引来麻烦的东西。就当这是宝贵的教训吧。我们走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210620,
					"content": "但是，烤鸡…那可是德波…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亨特"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210621,
					"content": "别管烤鸡了！我们该继续散步了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "特纳"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210622,
					"content": "「下回再让桑尼大哥请我们吃烤鸡。」\\n特纳说着，带着亨特离开了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210623
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210623,
					"content": "谢谢！谢谢你们，我就知道你们能够明白我的意思！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210624,
					"content": "#看来真的和{NICKNAME}说的一样…我们把恩里挖出来吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210625,
					"content": "不过，干这个事情需要很多体力，所以烤鸡就归我们啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210626,
					"content": "啊啊？可恶…没办法，只好答应了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210627,
					"content": "花费了一些时间将恩里从砂土中挖了出来，并将他身上不知为何套着的桶子取下来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210628
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210628,
					"content": "和派蒙一起开始吃香喷喷的烤鸡。\\n恩里看上去很想吃。但他守住了诺言和尊严，并没有开口要。\\n但派蒙看到恩里的样子，还是主动把烤鸡分给他了。\\n外皮烤得香脆无比，散发着油脂香气。非常美味！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
