			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741210801,
					"content": "自由！啊啊，甜美的自由！虽然不如烤鸡香，但还是很甜美！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210802,
					"content": "…所以说，你手里的牌子到底是什么意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210803,
					"content": "嗯？这个啊，这是「抗议」的意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210804,
					"content": "抗议什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210805,
					"content": "唔，怎么说呢…他们，也就是把我埋在地里的那些人，他们不希望我努力工作，所以我要抗议！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210806,
					"content": "不对，为什么有人不希望你努力工作呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210807,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210808,
					"content": "你能保守秘密吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210809,
					"content": "嗯！当然可以！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210810,
					"content": "那我也能。这个确实不方便说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210811,
					"content": "什么嘛！可恶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210812,
					"content": "还是聊点别的吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210813,
					"content": "好吧…那这个桶子又是怎么回事？身上套着桶子，也是抗议的一种形式吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210814,
					"content": "啊？这个我不知道…他们把我埋起来之前，在我胸口套了个桶子，真是恶趣味！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210815,
					"content": "那恩里又是为什么被他们埋起来的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210816,
					"content": "因为那些人坏透了！无缘无故就把我抓起来，埋在砂土里！这些人，就想要我死！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210817,
					"content": "真的是无缘无故吗…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210818
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210818,
					"content": "当、当然！你看，他们都把我埋在土里了啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210819,
					"content": "如果不是为了要我的命，怎么会把我埋在土里！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210820,
					"content": "#唔，感觉恩里说的话也有点道理…{NICKNAME}，你怎么看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
